OL,3,ABurnham insists 'no confusion at all'
OL,4,Aover his Brexit position
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,7,Faccused him during Prime Minister's
OL,8,FQuestions on Wednesday of failing to
OL,9,F"respect" the 2016 Brexit vote.
